WEBVTT

00:04:30.356 --> 00:04:32.476
And what if it is the same problem

00:04:32.516 --> 00:04:36.116
that causes racism and sexism and ableism?

00:04:36.116 --> 00:04:38.916
What if all of these things
are just symptoms

00:04:38.956 --> 00:04:41.116
of a bigger problem?

00:04:41.556 --> 00:04:42.716
Ready?

00:04:43.676 --> 00:04:47.876
White supremacist patriarchal capitalism.

00:04:50.116 --> 00:04:54.196
(Applause)

00:04:54.236 --> 00:04:58.316
It feels scary
because it feels like a concept,

00:04:58.356 --> 00:05:01.036
even though our society
is quite literally based on it.